Hi <%= @resource.first_name %>,

Use the link below to choose a password for the Cap City member website:

<%= edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>

The link works for <%= distance_of_time_in_words(Devise.reset_password_within) %>. After that, ask for a new one from the sign-in page.

If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore it. Your password stays the same until you use the link.
